{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果中國區排名第一的國民級效率應用「<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/cn/app/id406170251\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>倒數日·Days Matter</strong></a>」剛剛正式推出支持蘋果首款摺疊機 iPhone Duo 的5.4版，不僅全面支持摺疊屏外屏和內屏雙重模式，還特別支持蘋果獨家「帳篷模式」，讓你的 iPhone Duo 變成一個超貴的桌面倒數日曆。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583544.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T07:23:54.636268+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T07:00:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T07:18:03.676290+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T07:18:03.676290+00:00","content_hash":"ae7da7341ca6454c7059df6b9d6d963352cd35eaf10cbb44153fc5c774885ce9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}